WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:01.740
This is Thesisfic.

2
00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:10.100
Your assignment is written here, in an editor that works like Docs or Word, and every sentence keeps a record of where it came from.

3
00:00:11.251 --> 00:00:12.962
You write as you always do.

4
00:00:13.012 --> 00:00:17.658
Everything you type counts as written, and the margin shows it in green.

5
00:00:17.708 --> 00:00:20.201
There is no detector, and no suspicion.

6
00:00:21.351 --> 00:00:25.883
When you paste a passage, the editor simply asks where it comes from.

7
00:00:25.933 --> 00:00:30.199
Declare it as a quote, add the source, and it is marked in amber.

8
00:00:30.249 --> 00:00:31.926
Attributed, never accused.

9
00:00:33.078 --> 00:00:36.129
Thesisfic AI is paid for by your university.

10
00:00:36.179 --> 00:00:37.468
It thinks with you:

11
00:00:37.518 --> 00:00:40.357
it critiques, outlines and finds sources.

12
00:00:40.407 --> 00:00:42.753
It never writes your text for you.

13
00:00:43.903 --> 00:00:48.659
Before anything from the assistant goes into your document, you see the cost:

14
00:00:48.709 --> 00:00:53.528
the words added, and your new share of AI against the limit of your programme.

15
00:00:55.297 --> 00:00:58.377
Once inserted, the passage is marked in violet.

16
00:00:58.427 --> 00:01:02.172
You keep control, and the provenance stays with the text.

17
00:01:03.322 --> 00:01:05.441
The Integrity ledger adds it up:

18
00:01:05.491 --> 00:01:07.406
written, quoted, AI-assisted.

19
00:01:07.456 --> 00:01:12.422
Every item is visible, and every notice comes with an action you can take.

20
00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:18.296
Your advisor opens the same document and sees exactly the same ledger.

21
00:01:18.346 --> 00:01:22.523
Nothing is hidden from you, and nothing is inferred about you.

22
00:01:23.674 --> 00:01:24.356
Thesisfic.

23
00:01:24.406 --> 00:01:27.799
We teach your students how to use AI, properly.

